ANetBBS v1.0a2.19 - Alpha 2 - Modern BBS
-----------------------------------------
Web (Flask+SocketIO), telnet, SSH, rlogin,
FTP front-ends sharing one user database.
FidoNet BinkP echomail/netmail w/ full
kludges, DOVE-Net QWK, Inter-BBS IM via
MSP (TCP 18) + SYSTAT (UDP 11). MRC chat
w/ status bar + tab-complete. LORD pre-
installed (Synchronet JS port via Node
compat shim - no jsexec required). Built-
in collaborative wiki at /wiki/ w/ rev
history + diff + search. RSS reader, web
+ terminal. 80x25 CGA-palette web term
for doors. Synchronet .js + Mystic
.mps/.mpy + DOSBox doors w/ door32.
Sysop NodeSpy kick. CP437/ANSI throughout.
Linux + Python 3.10+ - ./install.sh
github.com/anetonline    By StingRay
